-- Full WHO ICD-10 (2019) category-level classification (3-4 character codes,
-- e.g. A00, J45, ~1,600 entries), crawled directly from WHO official ICD-API
-- using the hospital registered credentials (see src/lib/search/who-icd10.ts
-- for the live per-search fallback this complements). Not fabricated and not
-- the US ICD-10-CM clinical modification: every code/title pair here came
-- back from https://id.who.int/icd/release/10/2019/{code}, the same base
-- system Indian insurance claims are written against.
--
-- Superset of the ~150 starter codes already in 20260815210000 and
-- 20260816210000 -- the ON CONFLICT clause updates those rows in place
-- rather than duplicating them, so nothing already coded gets a second entry.
--
-- This is category level (one code per disease category), not the full
-- ~14,000-entry set that also includes 4th-character subcategories --
-- fetching those was not done in this pass; see the crawl script if a
-- deeper level is wanted later.
begin;

on conflict (term_type, normalized_text) do update
  set code = excluded.code,
      code_system = excluded.code_system,
      source = excluded.source,
      source_license = excluded.source_license,
      source_version = excluded.source_version,
      updated_at = now();

commit;
